@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Create order (reemplaza <GUID> por el id del customer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "<GUID>",
  "description": "Laptop",
  "total": 1500
}

### Cancel order (reemplaza <ORDER_GUID>)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/<ORDER_GUID>/cancel
